-R . ReserveGovernor
-Q /work/rocq/RocqOfSolidity RocqOfSolidity

-arg -impredicative-set
-arg -w
-arg -stdlib-vector

# Generated Yul-translation IR — produced by
# `bash scripts/solc-rocq --ir-rocq <contract.sol>`, captured under
# rocq/generated/. The smoke target below verifies the end-to-end
# toolchain (rocq-of-solidity library + amd64-on-arm64 solc fork) is
# wired correctly.
generated/Smoke.v

# Simulations and proofs are added here as they land. The standard
# per-domain tier shape (mirroring the protocol repo):
#
#   simulations/<Domain>.v
#   proofs/<Domain>.v
#   proofs/<Domain>_xcheck.v
#   proofs/<Domain>_validity.v
#   proofs/<Domain>_chain.v
#   proofs/<Domain>_witnesses.v
#   proofs/<Domain>_uint256_bounds.v
#
# Plus cross-cutting Audit.v at the end.

# --- ProposerThrottle ---
simulations/ProposerThrottle.v
proofs/ProposerThrottle.v
proofs/ProposerThrottle_validity.v
proofs/ProposerThrottle_xcheck.v

Audit.v
